# basePath Chapter6

::FirstContractOpenCh6
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
{@Player}   P.A.L., do you have details on what is going on at Kalvis? 
{@PAL}      Ah! I have a report of a minor operational incident at the Cu-6355-29...Kalvis mining facility.
{@Player}  Minor!? Mara said there was a mine collapse!
{@Player}   She said people were trapped. Blaze got hurt.
{@PAL}      The incident has been resolved and production remains within acceptable parameters.
{@Player}   That's not what I asked.
{@PAL}      Shall we get back to work, Captain?
{@Pal}		You have three contracts to pick from. 
{@Player}   ...Yeah. Sure.


::BeforeSupplyChainCh6
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Xavier}   Hey... uh. What's your name?
{@Player}   Locke.
{@Xavier}   Locke. Right. Listen, Winkler Station just opened up. Germanium.
{@Player}   That's in your sector?
{@Xavier}   Yep. Frontier's been tinkering around with autonomous workforces for a couple years.
{@Xavier}   And you'll never guess which station is seeing its first implementation.
{@Player}   ...Winkler.
{@Xavier}   Productivity's gonna go through the roof! Our margins are expected to boom this next quarter.
{@Player}   Wait, so what happened to the workers?
{@Xavier}   They've been... reassigned.
{@Xavier}   Telling you, the only people needed will be people like us.
{@Player}   Like us?
{@Xavier}   Managers of autonomous workforces.
{@Xavier}   Corporate's expecting us to up our cooperation percentage.
{@Xavier}   So don't disappoint. Expecting your business soon.

// hang up

{@Player}   ...does Frontier want to make everything autonomous?


